# Security headers for the static app (PLAN.md §11 step 2, 2026-11-04).
#
# Cloudflare's asset server applies this file; pages never pass through the
# Worker (only /api/* does, and worker/index.ts sets its own, stricter set).
# Vite copies it from public/ into dist/ unchanged.
#
# The Content-Security-Policy, piece by piece:
#   default-src 'self'          nothing from any other host, ever. The app has
#                               no CDN, fonts, analytics or third-party script.
#   script-src 'wasm-unsafe-eval'  the ONE exception: Argon2id (src/auth/derive.ts)
#                               runs as WebAssembly, which needs this. It allows
#                               compiling wasm only, not JavaScript eval.
#   style-src 'self'            no inline <style> or style="" markup. React sets
#                               styles through the DOM, which CSP allows.
#   img-src data: blob:         images built inside the page rather than fetched.
#   object-src / base-uri 'none'  no plugins; no <base> tag hijacking relative URLs.
#   frame-ancestors 'none'      nobody can frame the app (clickjacking).
#   form-action 'self'          a form can only ever submit back here.
#
# If a change needs a new host (barcode lookups, say), add it to connect-src
# here, by name. Never add 'unsafe-inline' or 'unsafe-eval' to script-src.
#
# Permissions-Policy turns off hardware the app does not use. Barcode scanning
# (PLAN.md §6, deferred) will need camera=(self).

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'; worker-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), serial=(), bluetooth=(), browsing-topics=()
